{title: Ek Kahani}
{artist: Gajendra Verma}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Teri [G]baatein mere [A]dil [G]ko yaad [D]aati hain
[D]Tu [G]naa [A]jaane mujhe [G]kitna [D]tadpaati hai
[Bm]Teri [A]aankhon mein [F#m]main [G]khone lagaa
[Bm]Teri [A]baaton se [F#m]kuch [G]hone lagaa
[Bm]Tu [A]hi [G]meri [D]zindgaani [G]hai [D]
[Bm]Teri [A]meri [G]ik [D]kahani [G]hai [D]
[Bm]Dil ye mera, [A]jaan ye meri
[G]Jaana ab [D]ye tumhara hai
[Bm]Tujhse hi [A]hai meri duniya
[G]Tu hi [D]mera sahara hai
[Bm]Mujh [A]par tu [F#m]ye ehsaan [G]kar de
[Bm]Mere [A]pal pal [F#m]mein khushiyan [G]bhar de
[Bm]Tu [A]hi [G]meri [D]zindgaani [G]hai [D]
[Bm]Teri [A]meri [G]ik [D]kahani [G]hai [D]
[D]Zikr bina tere [A]hongi na baatein meri
[F#m]Chaand bina tere [G]poori na raatein meri
[D]Bheeni bheeni si [A]teri mehak ko
[F#m]Shaam-o-subah to dhoonde [G]hain saans meri
[Bm]Kho kar [F#m]tujhko jee [G]naa paunga
[Bm]Tujh bin [F#m]main toh [G]mar hi jaaunga
[Bm]Tu [A]hi [G]meri [D]zindgaani [G]hai [D]
[Bm]Teri [A]meri [G]ik [D]kahani [G]hai [D]
[Bm]Teri meri [A]ik kahani hai
[G]Ik kahani, [D]ik kahani hai
